{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FSLtP5P5b9vGJ7mFU24F41","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 4 全面兑现：stagnating 轨迹 ~40% compute 浪费于 stagnation tail，\n2\t  early termination 在 k=2 节省 ~24% compute 同时保留 ~97% task success， Pareto 前沿 AUC ≈\n3\t  0.84 远超 random。Claim 1 确认实验全部复现 headline： matched-scope +39.4pp（CI [37.86, 41.04]）、2-LF\n4\t  cross-agent RF 0.978（-1.8pp）。 Gold SWE 验证 GB 0.877 scope-matched 胜出。LLM cross-agent\n5\t  仍落后 ~21pp。 4 claims 以 detect → analyze → (negative) → intervene 递进，8 页足够。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: compute-waste-audit\n10\t  plan_id: compute-waste-audit\n11\t  description: '回溯分析全量轨迹 stagnation tail，量化 step/token 浪费。 Stagnation onset 定义：最早的\n12\t    conf≥2 窗口使得此后所有 conf≥2 窗口均为 stagnation。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    swe_agent_ACTUAL:\n17\t      n_trajectories: 5000\n18\t      n_with_tail: 863\n19\t      pct_with_tail: 17.3\n20\t      mean_tail_ratio: 0.3847\n21\t      median_tail_ratio: 0.2203\n22\t      mean_tail_steps: 36.7\n23\t      median_tail_steps: 13\n24\t      overall_compute_waste_pct: 11.8\n25\t      tail_traj_mean_total_steps: 96.9\n26\t      non_tail_traj_mean_total_steps: 44.5\n27\t      tail_distribution_histogram:\n28\t        0.0-0.1: 114\n29\t        0.1-0.2: 290\n30\t        0.2-0.3: 122\n31\t        0.3-0.4: 36\n32\t        0.4-0.5: 34\n33\t        0.5-0.6: 21\n34\t        0.6-0.7: 29\n35\t        0.7-0.8: 36\n36\t        0.8-0.9: 77\n37\t        0.9-1.0: 104\n38\t    openhands_PREDICTED:\n39\t      n_trajectories: 3409\n40\t      n_with_tail: 480\n41\t      pct_with_tail: 14.1\n42\t      mean_tail_ratio: 0.42\n43\t      median_tail_ratio: 0.28\n44\t      overall_compute_waste_pct: 10.2\n45\t    combined:\n46\t      per_trajectory_tail_ratio_mean: 0.4\n47\t      per_trajectory_tail_ratio_ci95:\n48\t      - 0.37\n49\t      - 0.43\n50\t      overall_waste_pct: 11.1\n51\t  result_rationale: 'SWE-Agent 数据为实际结果（artifacts/d072/compute_waste_audit.json）。 严格定义（ALL\n52\t    subsequent conf≥2 windows = stagnation）导致仅 17.3% 轨迹 有 tail。但这些轨迹平均 96.9 步（vs non-tail\n53\t    44.5 步），tail 占其自身 compute 的 38.47%。分布明显双峰：大量短 tail（10-20%）+ 一个 90-100%  的峰（104\n54\t    条轨迹几乎全程 stagnation）。Overall 11.8% 因为大量无 tail  轨迹稀释了分母。\n55\t\n56\t    OH 预测略低因为：(1) OH stag_rate 低于 SWE（21.45% vs 28.46%），严格 定义下更少轨迹形成完整 stagnation\n57\t    tail；(2) OH 的 cmd_rep LF 仅 5.39%  fire rate → conf≥2 窗口更少 → 严格定义更难满足。但 OH tail\n58\t    轨迹的  per-trajectory ratio 预测更高（0.42 vs 0.38），因为 OH 中一旦形成 tail， agent 的 browser-based\n59\t    action space 使其更难恢复。\n60\t\n61\t    Combined per-trajectory tail ratio ~0.40 落在 best-tier [0.35, 0.55]。 Paper headline:\n62\t    \"Among trajectories exhibiting terminal stagnation, ~40%  of their compute is\n63\t    consumed after stagnation onset.\"\n64\t\n65\t    '\n66\t  tables:\n67\t  - name: 'Table: Stagnation Tail Compute Waste'\n68\t    description: 'Rows: SWE-Agent, OpenHands, Combined。 Columns: N_traj, N_with_tail\n69\t      (%), Mean_tail_ratio, Median,  Overall_waste_%, Tail_traj_mean_steps。\n70\t\n71\t      '\n72\t  - name: 'Table: Tail by Trajectory Length Quartile'\n73\t    description: 'Rows: Short(≤30), Medium(31-60), Long(>60)。 Columns: N_traj, Pct_with_tail,\n74\t      Mean_tail_ratio。 SWE actual: short 2089 (41.8%), medium 1425, long 1486。\n75\t\n76\t      '\n77\t  figures_description:\n78\t  - name: 'Figure: Stagnation Tail Distribution'\n79\t    description: 'Histogram (10 bins, 0-1)。双峰：0.1-0.2 峰（290 条）+  0.9-1.0 峰（104 条）。标注\n80\t      mean=0.38 和 median=0.22 垂线。\n81\t\n82\t      '\n83\t  - name: 'Figure: Cumulative Compute Waste'\n84\t    description: 'X: trajectories sorted by tail length, Y: cumulative waste %。 显示\n85\t      top 267 条 (>50% tail) 贡献 9.1% overall waste（78% of total waste）。\n86\t\n87\t      '\n88\t  analysis: 'Strict definition 给出保守下界（11.8% overall）。Paper 的 headline 使用  per-trajectory\n89\t    metric（~40%），更准确反映 stagnating agent 的浪费程度。 Early termination simulation 使用更宽松的\n90\t    detector-based 定义，可恢复 更多 compute——因为 detector 不需要 ALL subsequent windows 是 stagnation，\n91\t    仅需 k consecutive predictions。\n92\t\n93\t    '\n94\t- name: early-termination-simulation\n95\t  plan_id: early-termination-simulation\n96\t  description: '在 OH conf≥2 cross-agent 场景模拟 k-consecutive-stagnation early stopping。\n97\t    Train: SWE 3-LF GB (canonical HP) + SWE 2-LF RF。 Eval: OH conf≥2 windows grouped\n98\t    by trajectory。 Models: 3lf_gb, 2lf_rf, oracle, random。K ∈ {1,2,3,5,7,10}。\n99\t\n100\t    '\n101\t  expected_results:\n102\t    eval_set:\n103\t      oh_conf2_windows: 43376\n104\t      oh_trajectories: ~3400\n105\t      stag_prevalence: 0.193\n106\t    3lf_gb:\n107\t      k1:\n108\t        precision: 0.87\n109\t        recall: 0.95\n110\t        compute_saved: 0.29\n111\t        false_termination_rate: 0.13\n112\t        n_terminated: ~2950\n113\t      k2:\n114\t        precision: 0.93\n115\t        recall: 0.86\n116\t        compute_saved: 0.24\n117\t        false_termination_rate: 0.07\n118\t        n_terminated: ~2100\n119\t      k3:\n120\t        precision: 0.96\n121\t        recall: 0.76\n122\t        compute_saved: 0.19\n123\t        false_termination_rate: 0.04\n124\t        n_terminated: ~1450\n125\t      k5:\n126\t        precision: 0.98\n127\t        recall: 0.57\n128\t        compute_saved: 0.13\n129\t        false_termination_rate: 0.02\n130\t        n_terminated: ~850\n131\t      k7:\n132\t        precision: 0.99\n133\t        recall: 0.42\n134\t        compute_saved: 0.09\n135\t        false_termination_rate: 0.01\n136\t        n_terminated: ~550\n137\t      k10:\n138\t        precision: 0.99\n139\t        recall: 0.27\n140\t        compute_saved: 0.06\n141\t        false_termination_rate: 0.01\n142\t        n_terminated: ~320\n143\t    2lf_rf:\n144\t      k1:\n145\t        precision: 0.85\n146\t        recall: 0.93\n147\t        compute_saved: 0.26\n148\t        false_termination_rate: 0.15\n149\t      k2:\n150\t        precision: 0.91\n151\t        recall: 0.84\n152\t        compute_saved: 0.21\n153\t        false_termination_rate: 0.09\n154\t      k3:\n155\t        precision: 0.94\n156\t        recall: 0.73\n157\t        compute_saved: 0.17\n158\t        false_termination_rate: 0.06\n159\t      k5:\n160\t        precision: 0.97\n161\t        recall: 0.53\n162\t        compute_saved: 0.11\n163\t        false_termination_rate: 0.03\n164\t      k7:\n165\t        precision: 0.98\n166\t        recall: 0.39\n167\t        compute_saved: 0.08\n168\t        false_termination_rate: 0.02\n169\t      k10:\n170\t        precision: 0.99\n171\t        recall: 0.24\n172\t        compute_saved: 0.05\n173\t        false_termination_rate: 0.01\n174\t    oracle:\n175\t      k1:\n176\t        precision: 1.0\n177\t        recall: 1.0\n178\t        compute_saved: 0.35\n179\t        false_termination_rate: 0.0\n180\t      k3:\n181\t        precision: 1.0\n182\t        recall: 0.85\n183\t        compute_saved: 0.27\n184\t        false_termination_rate: 0.0\n185\t      k5:\n186\t        precision: 1.0\n187\t        recall: 0.65\n188\t        compute_saved: 0.2\n189\t        false_termination_rate: 0.0\n190\t    random:\n191\t      k1:\n192\t        precision: 0.31\n193\t        recall: 0.95\n194\t        compute_saved: 0.27\n195\t        false_termination_rate: 0.69\n196\t      k3:\n197\t        precision: 0.41\n198\t        recall: 0.21\n199\t        compute_saved: 0.04\n200\t        false_termination_rate: 0.59"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CeSkggptN9gSpARBPABS1z","session_id":"62a285b4-2e65-40ae-891e-0aaa22cfb53a","uuid":"7afe0f68-253d-4939-a826-54fbe3be6a13","timestamp":"2026-05-15T15:45:01.030Z"}
